  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/projects/minecraft/mods/more-barrel-variants/title_mr.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>纹理由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fhunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hunnycakehorse</a> 提供</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/lieon-studios-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/requires/quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img width=\"52\"><img width=\"26\"><img width=\"13\"><img width=\"8\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\"><img width=\"4\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lieonlion.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Stick-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <sup><img width=\"5\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/separator_v.svg\"> pnku:</sup> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pnku.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/pnku_de_logo.svg\" alt=\"pnku.de\"></a> <img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/dividers/horizontal/pnku_top.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>更多桶变体</h1>\n<p>为您的建筑增添色彩丰富的储物空间：现在每种木材类型都有专属的桶。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/q1y1g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>为 Minecraft 添加了 11 种新的<em>桶</em>。</h2>\n<h4>这些桶也可以通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nemos-woodcutter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo's Woodcutter</a>¹ 进行合成制作。</h4>\n<p>¹：在 1.11.3 及更高版本中。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方块替换功能：</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/9r8b9.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n观察热带草原村庄的渔夫小屋：我们可以看到，游戏中不再使用<em>云杉木桶</em>、<em>橡木火把</em>和普通的<em>堆肥桶</em>，而是生成带有<em><strong>金合欢木桶</strong></em>、<em><strong>金合欢木火把</strong></em>（来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把变体</a>）和<em><strong>金合欢木堆肥桶</strong></em>（来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-composter-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多堆肥桶变体</a>）的村庄。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
